@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Audiobook recommendations — system overview
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180

actor User
package "recommenderagent — live requests" {
  component "RequestGateway\nCoordinates the request" as Gateway #DBEAFE
  component "AiInputParser\nText → intent + criteria" as Parser #DBEAFE
  component "SessionTransitionService\nCoordinates paging and retrieval" as Session #DBEAFE
  component "AudiobookRecommendationWorkflow\nBuilds a new recommendation batch" as Workflow #DCFCE7
  component "CandidateRetrievalService\nSelects and executes search" as Retrieval #DCFCE7
  component "RankingService\nRanks up to 20 recommendations" as Ranking #DCFCE7
  component "AiResponseGenerator\nExplains the selected books" as Response #DBEAFE
  component "Database adapter\nCurrent runtime: Qdrant" as Adapter #FEF3C7
  component "SessionRepository adapter\nCurrent runtime: Redis" as SessionStore #FEF3C7
}
database "Qdrant\nCatalogue + book vectors\nUser preference vectors" as Qdrant
database "Redis\nSearch context + last page\nPending recommendations + shown IDs" as Redis

User -right-> Gateway : request / response
Gateway --> Parser : 1. Parse
Gateway --> Session : 2. Apply session transition
Session --> SessionStore : lock / load / commit / release
SessionStore --> Redis
Session --> Workflow : only when a new batch is needed
Workflow --> Adapter : load user preferences
Workflow --> Retrieval : retrieve up to 50 candidates
Retrieval --> Adapter : semantic / keyword / hybrid / filters
Adapter --> Qdrant
Workflow --> Ranking : rank candidates
Gateway --> Response : 3. Generate response after commit

note bottom of Session
  ConversationState owns conversation policy.
  The result carries a temporary ConversationOutcome.
  MORE: use pending recommendations first.
  REPEAT: reuse the last search outcome.
  MORE without a previous search: ask for criteria.
  These paths can skip retrieval and ranking.
end note
note bottom of Adapter
  Runtime code depends on storage interfaces.
  application.properties selects the adapter.
  Solr currently supports maintenance jobs;
  it is not yet a complete runtime backend.
end note
legend bottom
  Blue: request handling
  Green: fresh recommendation batch
  Yellow: replaceable storage adapters
  AI providers: parser chat, response chat and query embeddings
  Response pages: up to 5 recommendations
  Arrows: calls or data access, not inheritance
endlegend
@enduml
